  "review_corrections": [
    "Worker repository/commit links were wrong; curated report uses actual archived manifest commits.",
    "Static lighting resolver DOES handle skinned meshes when Skinning.Enabled is true.",
    "Skinned Remix mesh handles are per-drawable, not safely shareable merely via per-instance bone arrays.",
    "MaterialInfoTranslucentEXT, InstanceInfoBlendEXT and InstanceInfoBoneTransformsEXT are not fork-only.",
    "Official remix-1.6.1 header declares API 0.6.5; project vendor header declares 0.6.6.",
    "Shared D3D11 texture handle is exposed in fork header but not called by this plugin."
  ]
